@startuml
title D-02 Continuity Activation and Deactivation Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Supervisor / Authorized Role" as Supervisor
participant "Operator Console /\nApproved Operations Workflow" as Console
participant "ExitPass Continuity" as Continuity
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Continuity Terminal" as Terminal
participant "Dashboard / Reporting" as Dashboard

Supervisor -> Console : request / approve activation
Console -> Continuity : Site/Site Group, dependency,\nincident, reason, scope
Continuity -> Central : declare degraded mode and allowed workflows
Central -> Terminal : enable continuity mode if allowed
Continuity -> Dashboard : publish activation visibility

... periodic review interval ...

Supervisor -> Console : review restoration criteria
Console -> Continuity : approve deactivation / restoration
Continuity -> Central : close degraded mode
Central -> Terminal : disable continuity mode
Continuity -> Dashboard : move to post-restoration review

note over Continuity
Activation is explicit, audited,
reconciliation-tagged, and time-bound.
end note

@enduml
